  operatorDefaultSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 379e6871635899941a0ca8b2242fb357, type: 3}
  operatorHappySprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0c9ac23088833864089f886dd2e7847e, type: 3}
  baitoDefaultSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e18634539d2eba244b88783f2d8890f5, type: 3}
  baitoHappySprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 584baddc70a4d8444af40adf8603bcc4, type: 3}
  operatorDisplayNameKey: baalzebub
  baitoDisplayNameKey: baito
  operatorDisplayNameFallback: Baalzebub
  baitoDisplayNameFallback: Baito
  characterImage: {fileID: 649209665}
  speakerNameText: {fileID: 1373431097}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1454890088}
  textCompleteIndicator: {fileID: 767782382}
  dialoguePanelButton: {fileID: 2018320665}
  menuRoot: {fileID: 655495919}
  menuViews:
  - category: 0
    root: {fileID: 1924491442}
    button: {fileID: 1583773853}
    selectedHighlight: {fileID: 99708734}
    nameText: {fileID: 923633725}
    categoryText: {fileID: 1654868006}
    monologueTextKey: restaurant_menu_sword_monologue
    monologueText: The salty soy sauce flavor has soaked nicely into the broth. In
      the end this kind of dish is all about the basics.
  - category: 1
    root: {fileID: 1567892030}
    button: {fileID: 2114670546}
    selectedHighlight: {fileID: 942048418}
    nameText: {fileID: 2073538452}
    categoryText: {fileID: 1749630747}
    monologueTextKey: restaurant_menu_gun_monologue
    monologueText: Crisp on the outside and hot inside. Let your guard down and your
      tongue takes the first hit.
  - category: 2
    root: {fileID: 225178837}
    button: {fileID: 1543355420}
    selectedHighlight: {fileID: 594185980}
    nameText: {fileID: 832126671}
    categoryText: {fileID: 94415698}
    monologueTextKey: restaurant_menu_martial_monologue
    monologueText: The rich pork bone broth fills the mouth with weight. When you
      are hungry this is the right answer.
  - category: 3
    root: {fileID: 1822565381}
    button: {fileID: 955087565}
    selectedHighlight: {fileID: 1373207979}
    nameText: {fileID: 1261718820}
    categoryText: {fileID: 418894335}
    monologueTextKey: restaurant_menu_magic_monologue
    monologueText: A savory sweetness lingers behind the salt. This kind of broth
      is best enjoyed slowly.
  - category: 4
    root: {fileID: 1491677045}
    button: {fileID: 1026107960}
    selectedHighlight: {fileID: 1457259728}
    nameText: {fileID: 1193641848}
    categoryText: {fileID: 132211732}
    monologueTextKey: restaurant_menu_oni_monologue_format
    monologueText: My tongue stings but the chopsticks will not stop. This is what
      a dangerous flavor tastes like.
